  ('RUFUS', 'Romans 16:13', 'Greet Rufus, chosen in the Lord, and his mother, who has been a mother to me, too.', NOW()),
  ('SARAH', 'Genesis 17:15', 'God also said to Abraham, As for Sarai your wife, you are no longer to call her Sarai; her name will be Sarah.', NOW()),
  ('SARAI', 'Genesis 12:11', 'As he was about to enter Egypt, he said to his wife Sarai, I know what a beautiful woman you are.', NOW()),
  ('TEMAN', 'Habakkuk 3:3', 'God came from Teman, the Holy One from Mount Paran. His glory covered the heavens and his praise filled the earth.', NOW()),
  ('TIMON', 'Acts 6:5', 'This proposal pleased the whole group. They chose Stephen, a man full of faith and of the Holy Spirit; also Philip, Procorus, Nicanor, Timon, Parmenas, and Nicolas.', NOW()),
  ('URIAH', '2 Samuel 11:11', 'Uriah said to David, The ark and Israel and Judah are staying in tents, and my commander Joab and my lord''s men are camped in the open country.', NOW()),
  ('ZIMRI', '1 Kings 16:18', 'When Zimri saw that the city was taken, he went into the citadel of the royal palace and set the palace on fire around him. So he died.', NOW()),
  ('BABEL', 'Genesis 11:9', 'That is why it was called Babel — because there the LORD confused the language of the whole world. From there the LORD scattered them over the face of the whole earth.', NOW()),
