  ('GAZER', '1 Chronicles 14:16', 'So David did as God commanded him, and they struck down the Philistine army, all the way from Gibeon to Gazer.', NOW()),
  ('GOLAN', 'Deuteronomy 4:43', 'Golan in Bashan was one of the cities of refuge, set apart for the Manassites.', NOW()),
  ('HAZOR', 'Joshua 11:10', 'At that time Joshua turned back and captured Hazor and put its king to the sword. Hazor had been the head of all these kingdoms.', NOW()),
