  ('LYCIA', 'Acts 27:5', 'When we had sailed across the open sea off the coast of Cilicia and Pamphylia, we landed at Myra in Lycia.', NOW()),
  ('MARAH', 'Exodus 15:23', 'When they came to Marah, they could not drink its water because it was bitter. That is why the place is called Marah.', NOW()),
